{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010729","bookName":"Durmiendo con el hijo de mi exmarido","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010729/42000010729.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1582028,"followCount":51415,"introduction":"Natalia creó una empresa con éxito pero vivió un matrimonio desastroso. Se encontró que su exmarido, Hugo, la engañó con una pasante en la oficina — luego tuvo el descaro de burlarse de ella llamándola \"un pez muerto en la cama\". Furiosa, Natalia le dio una bofetada y se marchó sin mirar atrás. Tras el divorcio, Natalia se encuentra por casualidad con Sergio, el hijo de Hugo. ","chapterCount":62,"labels":["Forbidden Love","Age-Gap Love"],"tags":["Forbidden Love","Age-Gap Love"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Durmiendo-con-el-hijo-de-mi-exmarido","bookNameLower":"durmiendo-con-el-hijo-de-mi-exmarido","shelfTime":"2026-04-29 16:17:30","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-29 16:17:30","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700687622","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/22/9x2/92x7/927x0/92701000024/700687622_1/700687622.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=DydiUdqjYzVim9YoGJrRnyRNlLVTwECpQANRfQeRoS6EleYO47F2Fmmv4n7o2XaTWRXmBBs-JE05GrxUzfMkuzh~03mqB3-RlkGr4D4URZWH4p7qNZHz-bq2jz4rq2-Qr3NLt91nt18tKlY497ZHPCeWF7HMLDGPDr7K7FjhYZZNxcNxVHR9i-DgywLOAt-NCs~3w59Q3JQb-2u2dObD6YCcE7~YMKg0m-NZZkfy21pryIIV3tdCVDAZ8qQfayRrNlGwue~2ZdpGXxGxLY9EiFsiC09BHsWa2hzzJbekv7uQdXBLQglcqXEomwzXrYqg3NS4wqG6BkkJYc~j-DB9mA__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/22/9x2/92x7/927x0/92701000024/700687622_1/700687622.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":130590,"price":0},{"id":"700687623","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/32/9x2/92x7/927x0/92701000024/700687623_1/700687623.720p.narrowv3.mp